# StartFlow Copyright & Usage Policy

**Rights holder:** Clodo (https://clodo.net)
**Effective date:** 2026-10-16
**Version:** 1.0
**Product:** StartFlow

This policy applies strictly to the StartFlow plugin and its related materials, to which Clodo owns the rights. Third-party software, libraries, fonts, images, and user-generated content remain subject to their respective licenses and rights holders. All statutory rights, exceptions, and limitations granted under applicable law are expressly reserved and unaffected.

---

### 1. Covered Materials
- The StartFlow name, logo, and branding
- Source code, build scripts, configuration files, templates, and message files
- Compiled plugin files (.jar)
- Documentation, screenshots, and written content

---

### 2. Prohibited Uses
Without prior written authorization, you may not:
- Copy, clone, fork, mirror, or republish the source code, plugin files, or other materials.
- Modify, adapt, decompile, reverse-engineer, or create derivative works from the plugin or its source code.
- Redistribute, sublicense, resell, or commercially exploit the plugin or any of its materials.
- Use the StartFlow or Clodo names, logos, or marks, or imply any partnership, sponsorship, or official affiliation with Clodo.
- Scrape, crawl, extract, or harvest content, code, or data from our repositories, pages, or services in bulk.
- **AI & Model Training:** Use, ingest, or feed any of our content, code, documentation, or media to train, fine-tune, or develop artificial intelligence (AI) or machine learning (ML) models.

---

### 3. Permitted Uses
- **Server Use:** You may download the official release from our official pages (Modrinth, Hangar, CurseForge, or this repository) and run it free of charge on Minecraft servers you own or administer, including public and commercial servers.
- **Configuration:** You may edit the plugin's configuration, template, and message files on your own server to customize its behavior and language.
- **Reading the Source:** You may view the source code for review, security auditing, and learning purposes.
- **Bug Reports and Suggestions:** You may open issues and share feedback. Contributions are accepted only after written agreement with Clodo.
- **Link Sharing & Embeds:** You may share direct links to our official pages, repository, and announcements, including the standard automatic previews generated by platforms.
- **Search-Engine Indexing:** Search engines may index our public pages.
- **Personal AI Summarization:** You may use AI tools to summarize or analyze our public content for your own personal use, provided the content is not republished or used to train or fine-tune any model.

> **Note:** Beyond the uses listed above, no permission is granted. Re-uploading, republishing, framing, or copying the underlying content remains prohibited.

