### 6. Enforcement & Violations
Failure to comply with this policy may result in enforcement measures, including:
- Formal takedown notices and removal requests.
- Reporting violations directly to platform providers, hosting services, and domain registrars.
- Legal action to seek injunctive relief, damages, and other appropriate remedies.
